# `<name> <version-range>  # <which test needs it>`. This file is
# generator-owned and rewritten on every generation. It is the contract between
# the generator and a client that keep-lists its own pubspec.yaml. Dart
# resolves every import at compile time, so a missing entry here fails the
# whole suite in `dart pub get`/`dart test` compilation rather than at run
# time; there is no bootstrap that can run first and name this file.
